<title>NORWAY: Statoil sets up Danish bunker venture.</title>
<headline>Statoil sets up Danish bunker venture.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Thursday Statoil Denmark and Haahr Petroleum Ltd had set up a joint company to sell bunkers.</p>
<p>The 50/50 venture, Haahr Statoil Bunker, will be established in August and will supply bunkers and spot sales of lubricants to ocean-going vessels in Danish coastal waters and ports.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
